# firebase/functions compiles to lib/ (its tsconfig outDir). ANCHORED — the leading path
# segments matter. A bare `lib/` would also match firebase/functions/src/lib/, the real source
# directory holding identity.ts and the invite/group/activity helpers, and silently stop
# formatting it. That exact mistake has already been made twice in this repo: in .gitignore,
# where it kept those files out of git entirely, and in eslint.config.js.
#
# Its absence here was its own bug: `pnpm format:check` passed or failed depending on whether
# you happened to have built recently, and CI never noticed because CI does not run it.
